3. Such notice shall include:
(1)
surname, name (patronymic), date and place of birth, nationality of the sentenced person;
(2)
information about permanent place of residence of the sentenced person in the Receiving state, if known;
(3)
a statement of the facts, upon which the sentence was based;
(4)
the nature, duration and date of commencement of the sentence;
(5)
a certified copy of the judgement;
(6)
the text of applicable provisions of the criminal laws;
(7)
report of the medical condition of the sentenced person and other relevant information.
